# Build contexts: repository root (backend) and frontend/. Keep large / local-only files out of images.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
backend/.venv
data/argus.db*
data/runtime
data/processed
data/imports
data/realdata/_cache
data/realdata/*/generated
data/realdata/*/.extract-*
